        <mxCell id="fv-sflow" parent="fv-ms" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;b&gt;Signal flow (forward pass):&lt;/b&gt; Stack-Input (J3/J4/J5) -&gt; (J1/J2/J3) ROT 1 (J4/J5/J6) -&gt; (J1/J2/J3) ROT 2 (J4/J5/J6) -&gt; (J1/J2/J3) ROT 3 (J4/J5/J6) -&gt; (J1/J2/J3) ROT 4 (J4/J5/J6) -&gt; (J1/J2/J3) ROT 5 (J4/J5/J6) -&gt; (J3/J4/J5) Stack-Output&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Signal flow (to-reflector):&lt;/b&gt; Stack-Output (J6) -&gt; (J1) Stack-Interposer (J2) -&gt; (J6) Stack-Input (J2) -&gt; Stack-Blanking -&gt; (J2) Stack-Output (J1) -&gt; Cypher&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Signal flow (from-reflector):&lt;/b&gt; Cypher -&gt; (J1) Stack-Output (J2) -&gt; Stack-Blanking -&gt; (J2) Stack-Input (J6) -&gt; (J2) Stack-Interposer (J1) -&gt; (J6) Stack-Output&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Signal flow (reverse pass):&lt;/b&gt; Stack-Output (J3/J4/J5) -&gt; (J4/J5/J6) ROT 5 (J1/J2/J3) -&gt; (J4/J5/J6) ROT 4 (J1/J2/J3) -&gt; (J4/J5/J6) ROT 3 (J1/J2/J3) -&gt; (J4/J5/J6) ROT 2 (J1/J2/J3) -&gt; (J4/J5/J6) ROT 1 (J1/J2/J3) -&gt; (J3/J4/J5) Stack-Input" vertex="1">
